zing on the chaos, Aberdeen were awarded a penalty in the 95th minute. Kevin Nisbet stepped up to calmly slot home his second of the game, completing a stunning turnaround. Despite a late yellow card for Nisbet during the celebrations, Aberdeen held firm through eleven minutes of stoppage time to claim all three points."
