 further. A flurry of substitutions followed for both Hearts and Dundee United , with players like James Wilson , Neil Farrugia , and Panutche Camara introduced to see out the game. Despite late efforts from the visitors, the home side remained disciplined until the final whistle blew at 90+4 minutes, securing a comprehensive victory."
